{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>視帝黃宗澤（Bosco）近日與劇集《風華背後》的拍檔涂毓麟及蘇麗珊現身青海拍攝節目，頻頻被拍到在不同地方閑逛工作。黃宗澤內地人氣高企，就連到較遠的內陸地區仍然被超多影迷認出跟隨，且排場極大，連去廁所都被影住！</p><figure><img alt=\"黃宗澤人氣高企。(ig@boscomine)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120587011208515584567321.jpeg/f65j50_j4El2gKvw5B7ROdl-e_IdUEkUXUM1Zl1DNWY\"/><figcaption>黃宗澤人氣高企。(ig@boscomine)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃宗澤在社交平台分享了一輯帥照。(ig@boscomine)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120587013481959424104652.jpeg/4-ywMtznE6kf8Vvc-7jVKyPDwh97_58GZcbibmXG4m4\"/><figcaption>黃宗澤在社交平台分享了一輯帥照。(ig@boscomine)</figcaption></figure><p>黃宗澤青海去廁所被影</p><p>黃宗澤現身青海震驚內地影迷，早前他曾被網民拍得在有「內地天空之鏡」之稱的的茶卡鹽湖跳舞。黃宗澤近日又被拍到在黑獨山，就連在荒漠都有大批影迷跟隨，黃宗澤出行排場極大，十數名工作人員包圍，足見人氣！黃宗澤就連去廁所都被影住，他去完廁所洗手，在門外甩乾對手，都有一堆人包圍保護住。不過黃宗澤已經習慣被人群包圍，笑笑口神態自然，十分型仔。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃宗澤去青海荒漠都排場好大。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136345042609246208894276.jpeg/IWIw7G9ZnQEJAu1g_NyJ72S9aSJaap20pFctb6RXLW8\"/><figcaption>黃宗澤去青海荒漠都排場好大。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁多影迷。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136345055071047680785693.jpeg/U91MMkjhz6q7kFJTqEUn_EzYJ9qpHzGZDc3pAw3N6QM\"/><figcaption>勁多影迷。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人氣勁。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136345052663386112064739.jpeg/3Lyz7LaY-gtnHyLvXIOHr1c-gZ-RmFkWXX4TxF1-E8Q\"/><figcaption>人氣勁。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多人包圍！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136345050402525184195364.jpeg/UCFNIjHJFnfDnJ54c_4jH0qcuV3my1_fCp_jywqf48s\"/><figcaption>好多人包圍！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃宗澤去廁所都被影住。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136345048129081344538914.jpeg/JFUAlwaKeltwQWf-OjtnvZ0RBKAYSg2Zc3PosnNz6LI\"/><figcaption>黃宗澤去廁所都被影住。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃宗澤去完廁所洗手。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136345045721419776930617.jpeg/kv2CzfG8VcsTdK1YtTdv0LqrKBImXYgDjMF5-ozBefo\"/><figcaption>黃宗澤去完廁所洗手。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T12:39:09.815603+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":421,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}